  <section class="wrap fiche-body">
    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>Set right by the water at the Cavalaire harbour, this restaurant focuses on fresh seafood and fish, paired with a fine wine selection. The air-conditioned terrace with harbour views makes it a comfortable address in summer as well as autumn, and pets are welcome. Very highly rated: 4.3/5 across more than 730 reviews.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you go</h2>
      <p>Important correction to what we previously stated ("lunch and dinner every day"): three consistent independent directories indicate that the restaurant actually serves in the evening only (6:30pm-3am), Monday to Saturday, closed Sunday — with lunch service on weekdays in low season only. Check the day's hours before coming, especially if you were planning to have lunch there in the middle of summer.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: go for the evening service to enjoy the sunset over the boats in the harbour, with your dog settled quietly next to the table.</div>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>The Cavalaire-sur-Mer harbour and its shops are just steps away, handy for extending your walk before or after the meal.</p>
